# Git Workflow

## Default flow

```
feature/* → local test → (optional staging) → PR/review → main → production deploy → health check
```

## Rules

- Prefer working on a feature branch for large changes; small hotfixes may be discussed with the user.
- Commit **only** when the user asks. Never amend pushed history; never `--force` on `main`.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, keystores, private keys, uploaded PII).
- Commit messages: short why-focused sentences (fix/add/update).
- Do not use interactive git (`-i`).

## Deploy coupling

- Merging to GitHub ≠ automatic VPS deploy unless CI is configured and user intends it.
- Production APK publish is a separate explicit step from app commits.
